Exploratory Data Analysis
The notebook investigates score distributions, categorical relationships, and correlations. Reading and writing scores are strongly correlated, while mathematics shows comparatively lower averages. 
Visualizations such as histograms, boxplots, pairplots, violin plots, count plots, and correlation heatmaps were used to identify trends and patterns.
